    "founderBio": "Baraka grew up in the Udzungwa Mountains, came to Kilimanjaro as a porter and worked his way up to licensed guide (KINAPA) before founding Kilimanjaro Nature Tours in Arusha. He is certified in Wilderness First Response, teaches first aid and CPR to his crew, and still answers every message himself.",
